My Saturday morning at the café is over.
Now I am back home and relaxing in the flat.
Tonight my friends from badminton are coming to visit.
I have invited Lena and Timo for dinner.
I want to cook something truly local.
I take the mobile phone and search for Berlin recipes.
I find a video by a well-known Berlin chef.
He is making potato salad with meatballs.
That is a real classic!
The chef in the video has a lot of energy.
He speaks directly into the camera.
"Write down the recipe!" he shouts loudly.
"First buy fresh ingredients!"
"Then cook with love!"
"Afterwards eat like a real Berliner!"
I laugh at his funny manner.
This dish is perfect for tonight.
Now I just have to check what I need to buy.
